h necessitates his having a bodyguard, the English MI6 agent, Major Jack ('Bishounen-Killer') Bancoran. Bancoran's nickname doesn't mean he shoots bishounen in cold blood. The soubriquet comes from the fact that no male under the age of 17 can resist his sexual fascination. This, to Bancoran's eternal disgust, includes Patarillo himself. The action switches often from Marinera to MI6 headquarters in London (London seems to be an easy two hour's flight from the South Seas) or Bancoran's palatial condo in the suburbs of same. (MI6, be it noted, looks a lot like Fritz Lang's Metropolis, while Jack's 'apartment' bears a passing resemblance to Randolph Hearst's spread.) The action also goes into the past and future and out into space. Patarillo evidently gets around.","duration":48,"endDate":{"day":10,"month":7,"year":1983},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[],"genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Romance"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":66,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[["PARENT",2835,2835,"ANIME","TV"]],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":1983,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":10,"month":7,"year":1983},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":11,"score":10},{"amount":4,"score":20},{"amount":15,"score":30},{"amount":16,"score":40},{"amount":28,"score":50},{"amount":58,"score":60},{"amount":35,"score":70},{"amount":54,"score":80},{"amount":34,"score":90},{"amount":31,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":26,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":427,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":449,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":34,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":20,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[[18,"Toei Animation",false,true]],"synonyms":["Pataliro! Stardust Program"],"title":{"english":null,"native":"パタリロ！スターダスト計画","romaji":"Patalliro! Stardust Keikaku"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793711257},"12665":{"al":12665,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12665-rUxI